# Cloudflare Pages headers
#
# IMPORTANT: Files under /assets/ use STABLE filenames that are replaced in place
# on deploy (collection covers, logos, heroes). Never mark them `immutable` with a
# long max-age — Safari (and other browsers) will keep the old bytes for the full
# TTL and will not revalidate. Collection covers also use ?v=<content-hash>
# (see js/asset-versions.js) so deploys bust browser caches immediately.
#
# HTML stays on the Cloudflare Pages default: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate.

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800, must-revalidate

/js/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800, must-revalidate

/css/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800, must-revalidate

/styles.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800, must-revalidate

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
